{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《三代同糖》驚喜彩蛋曝光！劇中將會出土車婉婉34年前參加新秀歌唱大賽的青澀舊照，她本人受訪時笑言不敢重溫，更自嘲當年妝容誇張到「打冷震」，並親揭一段當年關於綵排的難忘黑仔史！</p><p>車婉婉34年前新秀照曝光 自嘲濃妝打冷震</p><p>在今、明兩晚播出的《三代同糖》中，將有兩大彩蛋送給觀眾。第一大彩蛋，就是車婉婉於1992年參加新秀歌唱大賽時的青澀樣將會在劇中首度出土。事隔34年，婉婉受訪時笑言自己其實不敢翻看當時的照片，皆因覺得「個妝仲濃過依家」，她更搞笑表示：「因為嗰時唔識吖嘛，依家睇番都打冷震。」</p><p>車婉婉親揭新秀黑仔史 10個人得佢冇得綵排</p><p>除了舊照，車婉婉更開心分享了當年參加新秀時一段既搞笑又不幸的難忘回憶。她憶述當時綵排需要抽籤決定，但命運似乎跟她開了個玩笑。婉婉說：「好記得嗰時要抽籤先有得綵排，嗰時有十個人，前後抽咗三次，而十個人入面得我一個（抽唔中）冇綵排過，所以好深刻。」成為唯一一位沒有綵排過的參賽者，經歷相當特別。</p><p>趙浚承吳兆麟惡搞《越難越愛》 劇中彩蛋一浪接一浪</p><p>除了車婉婉的懷舊彩蛋，劇組還準備了另一驚喜。在劇中擔任《當年好聲音》評審的趙浚承，將會夥拍吳兆麟，在節目中七情上面地惡搞吳若希的經典K歌《越難越愛》。兩位男演員將如何演繹這首情深歌曲，預告一出已令期待值爆燈，勢必為劇情增添不少笑料。</p><p>網民洗版期待舊照：回憶返哂嚟</p><p>預告一出，網民對兩大彩蛋反應熱烈，紛紛表示期待。「好想睇婉婉34年前個樣！一定好pure！」「笑死，十個人抽三次都抽唔中，真係黑仔王！」「以前啲化妝係咁上下啦，夠經典！」「惡搞《越難越愛》？呢個彩蛋好正，必睇！」「最鍾意聽明星講返以前啲故仔，好真實。」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_10014443926a8fc7b0a7965.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_1392530446a8fc7b2bdcff.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_19783909026a8fc7b6c6f09.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_17883124786a8fc7b9eb239.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/5d_8174155566a8fc7bd67814.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/5c_6871284286a8fc7c033919.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/5b_4877959066a8fc7c3656c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05a_7912307956a8fc7c67115a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_10557890356a8fc7ca09bb0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_3305025606a8fc7cd1b4ca.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_13141859846a8fc7d069869.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_12761007196a8fc7d3b1f22.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_4058255866a8fc7d67ea56.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10a_8648365536a8fc7d9c80bb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_11454616056a8fc7dd2bd33.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11a_17294149226a8fc7e04901a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_115599826a8fc7e398173.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_4500423216a8fc7e6e1355.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_18130964186a8fc7ea011a0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_13909033826a8fc7ed8ec1e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_7846205106a8fc7f326687.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_13253917996a8fc7f6324ec.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T05:19:02.051688+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":960,"images":22,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}